Package: seqbench
Title: Anytime-Valid Sequential Benchmarking of Algorithms
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("André", "Leite", , "leite@castlab.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Raydonal", "Ospina", , "raydonal@castlab.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Cristiano", "Ferraz", , "cferraz@castlab.org", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Sequential, anytime-valid comparison of algorithms on paired
    losses with a practical-equivalence margin. Confidence sequences for
    the mean paired difference, superiority/equivalence/continue
    decisions, cost accounting and auditable trajectories.
